Template: homelab-calendar/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap this app's roles/schema on:
 Used only once, at first install, to run homelab-bootstrap-app-role.

Template: homelab-calendar/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host to register this app's runtime role with:
 Used only once, at first install. Also written into config.yml's
 database.host, so the running service connects through the pooler.

Template: homelab-calendar/api_base
Type: string
Default: http://localhost:3000
Description: Base URL where homelab-api is reachable:
 Written into config.yml's homelab_api.base_url -- every sign-in is
 verified by introspecting the session's token here.

Template: homelab-calendar/listen_port
Type: string
Default: 2519
Description: Port for homelab-calendar to listen on:

Template: homelab-calendar/advertise_host
Type: string
Default: 127.0.0.1
Description: This host's own address to advertise in the service registry:
 Written into config.yml's registry.host. Set it to this host's service
 address for any distributed deployment.

Template: homelab-calendar/public_base_url
Type: string
Default: https://calendar.test.mailmasker.org
Description: Public URL of this calendar:
 Share links and ICS feed URLs are built from it; must match the name
 homelab-webproxy's sites.yml fronts this service as.

Template: homelab-calendar/default_timezone
Type: string
Default: America/Chicago
Description: Time zone used when an account has none:
 An IANA zone name. Each account's own zone (from homelab-api, or saved
 in this app's preferences) wins over it.

Template: homelab-calendar/sso_base_url
Type: string
Default: https://login.test.mailmasker.org
Description: Public base URL of homelab-sso (where the browser is sent to sign in):
 A BROWSER redirect: it must be the public SSO name, never an internal
 address (see homelab-drive's identical note).

Template: homelab-calendar/sso_internal_base_url
Type: string
Default:
Description: Internal base URL of homelab-sso for this app's own code exchange (blank = the public URL):

Template: homelab-calendar/sso_client_secret
Type: password
Description: Shared secret for this app's "calendar" OAuth client:
 Must match the 'calendar' client registered in homelab-sso's config.
 Leave blank to install without sign-in (share links still work) and add
 the sso: block to config.yml later.

Template: homelab-calendar/session_secret
Type: password
Description: Session secret (the SAME value on every node of the pool):
 Requests are not sticky across the pool, so a per-node secret would fail
 sign-ins two times in three. Leave blank on a single node to generate one.
